flowchart TD
  A[Run START_HERE.m] --> B[Resolve entry path with mfilename fullpath]
  B --> C[Walk upward to marker and project_config.json]
  C --> D[Validate project identity and declared path folders]
  D --> E[Add only MATLAB source folder]
  E --> F[Call main]
  F --> G[Create/check project-contained output report and log roots]
  G --> H[Reserve unique run folder and log names]
  H --> I[Parse and validate config and data manifest]
  I --> J[Resolve explicit manifest path]
  J --> K{File found?}
  K -- No --> L[Search exact filename in configured data roots]
  L --> M{Unique exact match?}
  M -- No match --> N[Optional documented regex rule]
  M -- Multiple --> O[Stop and list candidate paths]
  N --> P{Exactly one match?}
  P -- No --> O
  P -- Yes --> Q[Check format, root containment and SHA-256]
  K -- Yes --> Q
  Q --> R{Integrity passed?}
  R -- No --> S[Write STARTUP_FAILED log and stop]
  R -- Yes --> T[Write STARTUP_READY logs; calculations NOT_RUN]
